= Dawes Plan negotiation 

Germany has been spiralling from hyperinflation as a result of reparations payments along with Frances occupation of the Ruhr. We plan to meet with representatives from other western powers to discuss how this go down. The Plan is to set up a system for Germany's payment of war reparations, to provide a large loan to stabilise the German currency and try to end the Ruhr's occupation.

